{"id":14,"date":"2024-07-01T07:59:20","date_gmt":"2024-07-01T07:59:20","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/?page_id=14"},"modified":"2024-11-21T12:47:30","modified_gmt":"2024-11-21T12:47:30","slug":"about","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/about\/","title":{"rendered":"About"},"content":{"rendered":"\r\n<div class=\"hero-interior\">\r\n    <div class=\"background-image\">\r\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"290\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/ODYS-Pic_018-1.jpg\" class=\"desktop-image\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/ODYS-Pic_018-1.jpg 1920w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/ODYS-Pic_018-1-300x45.jpg 300w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/ODYS-Pic_018-1-1024x155.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/ODYS-Pic_018-1-768x116.jpg 768w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/ODYS-Pic_018-1-1536x232.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" \/>    <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"hero-bottom\" style=\"opacity:0\">\r\n        <div class=\"dots-grid\" style=\"background-image:url('https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/themes\/odyssey\/dist\/images\/one-dot.png');\"><\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"hero-box  \">\r\n                            <div class=\"heading split-text\"><h1>Extraordinary Leaps<br \/>\nCreate Extraordinary<br \/>\nPatient Outcomes<\/h1>\n<\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"hero-box-bottom\">\r\n                <div class=\"text-wrap\">\r\n                                            <div class=\"description split-text\"><p>We have established a replicable and scalable model for drug discovery and development and are advancing a diversified portfolio of programs with the intention of efficiently delivering safe and effective medicines to patients with autoimmune and inflammatory diseases.<\/p>\n<p>We bring together some of the best proven talents in pharma and biotech to redefine how inflammatory diseases are treated, driven by an unwavering commitment to make a meaningful difference.<\/p>\n<p>This is <em>our<\/em> Odyssey. Let&#8217;s take extraordinary leaps in patient outcomes, together.<\/p>\n<\/div>\r\n                                                        <\/div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"side-image inview-animate--fade\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"796\" height=\"531\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/ODYS-Pic_029.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"A scientist handling test tubes\" srcset=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/ODYS-Pic_029.jpg 796w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/ODYS-Pic_029-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/ODYS-Pic_029-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/ODYS-Pic_029-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 796px) 100vw, 796px\" \/><\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>            \r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\n\n\r\n<div  class=\"text-and-image with-split-text empty-section\">\r\n    <div class=\"background-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1033\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/ODYS-Pic_001-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/ODYS-Pic_001-1.jpg 1920w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/ODYS-Pic_001-1-300x161.jpg 300w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/ODYS-Pic_001-1-1024x551.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/ODYS-Pic_001-1-768x413.jpg 768w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/ODYS-Pic_001-1-1536x826.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" \/><\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"mobile-background-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"396\" height=\"265\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/ODYS-Pic_001.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/ODYS-Pic_001.jpg 396w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/ODYS-Pic_001-300x201.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 396px) 100vw, 396px\" \/><\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n        <div class=\"inner\">\r\n            <div class=\"dots-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/themes\/odyssey\/dist\/images\/dots.png\" alt=\"dots grid\"><\/div>\r\n                                                        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\n\n\r\n<div class=\"video-section with-split-text\">\r\n    <div class=\"inner\">\r\n                    <div class=\"heading split-text\"><h3>Our Odyssey Is Powered by Our Values<\/h3>\n<\/div>\r\n                <div class=\"video\">\r\n                            <div class=\"video-poster\">\r\n                    <div class=\"video-poster-inner\">\r\n                        <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1364\" height=\"783\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/values-video-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"Video about Odyssey Therapeutics values\" srcset=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/values-video-1.jpg 1364w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/values-video-1-300x172.jpg 300w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/values-video-1-1024x588.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/values-video-1-768x441.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1364px) 100vw, 1364px\" \/>                        <svg class=\"video-play\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\" viewBox=\"0 0 130 130\">\r\n                            <g id=\"Group_591\" data-name=\"Group 591\" transform=\"translate(-870 -2191)\">\r\n                                <g id=\"Ellipse_69\" data-name=\"Ellipse 69\" transform=\"translate(870 2191)\" fill=\"#cb4726\" stroke=\"#707070\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.75\">\r\n                                <circle cx=\"65\" cy=\"65\" r=\"65\" stroke=\"none\"\/>\r\n                                <circle cx=\"65\" cy=\"65\" r=\"64.5\" fill=\"none\"\/>\r\n                                <\/g>\r\n                                <path id=\"Polygon_2\" data-name=\"Polygon 2\" d=\"M19.5,0,39,34H0Z\" transform=\"translate(960 2236) rotate(90)\" fill=\"#fff\"\/>\r\n                            <\/g>\r\n                        <\/svg>\r\n                        <svg class=\"video-loader\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid\" class=\"lds-eclipse\"><path ng-attr-d=\"{{config.pathCmd}}\" ng-attr-fill=\"{{config.color}}\" stroke=\"none\" d=\"M20 50A30 30 0 0 0 80 50A30 34 0 0 1 20 50\" fill=\"#CB4726\" transform=\"rotate(282 50 52)\"><animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"rotate\" calcMode=\"linear\" values=\"0 50 52;360 50 52\" keyTimes=\"0;1\" dur=\"1s\" begin=\"0s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"><\/animateTransform><\/path><\/svg>\r\n                                                    <p class=\"video-title\">Living Our Values<\/p>\r\n                                            <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                                    <div style=\"padding:56.25% 0 0 0;position:relative;\"><iframe src=\"https:\/\/player.vimeo.com\/video\/1029030563?h=8e8b92488b&amp;badge=0&amp;autopause=0&amp;player_id=0&amp;app_id=58479\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture; clipboard-write\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;\" title=\"oddysey values v010 rfh approved\"><\/iframe><\/div><script src=\"https:\/\/player.vimeo.com\/api\/player.js\"><\/script>        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\n\n\r\n<div class=\"icons-and-heading\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n        <div class=\"inner inview-animate--fade\">\r\n                            <div class=\"icon-wrap\" style=\"transition-delay:0s\">\r\n                    <div class=\"icon\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Group-593.svg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"icon-heading\"><h5>HONOR THE PATIENT<\/h5><\/div>\r\n                                            <div class=\"icon-description\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">We make the protection and<br \/>\nadvancement of patient wellbeing<br \/>\nour first decision filter.<\/p>\n<\/div>\r\n                                    <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"icon-wrap\" style=\"transition-delay:0.2s\">\r\n                    <div class=\"icon\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Group-595.svg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"icon-heading\"><h5>RESPECT THE SCIENCE<\/h5><\/div>\r\n                                            <div class=\"icon-description\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">We bring the highest standards<br \/>\nof scientific inquiry and<br \/>\nexcellence to our work.<\/p>\n<\/div>\r\n                                    <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"icon-wrap\" style=\"transition-delay:0.4s\">\r\n                    <div class=\"icon\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Group-597.svg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"icon-heading\"><h5>RAISE EACH OTHER UP<\/h5><\/div>\r\n                                            <div class=\"icon-description\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">We help each other grow, have<br \/>\neach other\u2019s backs, and share<br \/>\nour knowledge generously.<\/p>\n<\/div>\r\n                                    <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"icon-wrap\" style=\"transition-delay:0.6s\">\r\n                    <div class=\"icon\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Group-599.svg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"icon-heading\"><h5>ACT WITH URGENCY<\/h5><\/div>\r\n                                            <div class=\"icon-description\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">We fearlessly break through barriers<br \/>\nthat slow down our quest to get<br \/>\nmedicines to patients.<\/p>\n<\/div>\r\n                                    <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"icon-wrap\" style=\"transition-delay:0.8s\">\r\n                    <div class=\"icon\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Group-601.svg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"icon-heading\"><h5>DO WHAT\u2019S RIGHT<\/h5><\/div>\r\n                                            <div class=\"icon-description\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">We act with integrity, value the<br \/>\npatient in every decision and<br \/>\nkeep our promises.<\/p>\n<\/div>\r\n                                    <\/div>\r\n                            <div class=\"icon-wrap\" style=\"transition-delay:1s\">\r\n                    <div class=\"icon\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Group-603.svg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" \/><\/div>\r\n                    <div class=\"icon-heading\"><h5>OWN OUR SUCCESS<\/h5><\/div>\r\n                                            <div class=\"icon-description\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">We are invested in our shared<br \/>\nachievements and do what it takes<br \/>\nto get results.<\/p>\n<\/div>\r\n                                    <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\n\n\r\n<div class=\"image-and-links with-split-text\">\r\n    <div class=\"section-wrap\">\r\n                            <div class=\"links\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"links-inner\">\r\n                                                    <div class=\"text-wrap\">\r\n                                <div class=\"text-heading split-text\"><h3>Our Odyssey Is Guided by Our Leaders<\/h3>\n<\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"description split-text\"><p>Our leadership team has deep experience in identifying, developing and commercializing medicines, and in leading, founding or building biopharmaceutical companies. Their differentiated insights and expertise provide the foundation to address historically challenging targets for patients suffering from autoimmune and inflammatory diseases.<\/p>\n<\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"button-wrap\"><a href=\"\/leadership\" class=\"btn line white-stroke\"><svg class=\"button-circle\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"78\" height=\"78\" viewBox=\"0 0 78 78\"><g id=\"Ellipse_9\" data-name=\"Ellipse 9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#687477\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"1\" opacity=\"0.7\"><circle cx=\"39\" cy=\"39\" r=\"39\" stroke=\"none\"\/><circle cx=\"39\" cy=\"39\" r=\"38.75\" fill=\"none\"\/><\/g><\/svg><svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"40.814\" height=\"13.967\" viewBox=\"0 0 40.814 13.967\"><path id=\"Icon_core-arrow-bottom\" data-name=\"Icon core-arrow-bottom\" d=\"M21.328,17.9l-4.98,4.98V-14.761h-1.66V22.875L9.708,17.9,8.534,19.069l6.984,6.984L22.5,19.069Z\" transform=\"translate(14.761 22.502) rotate(-90)\" fill=\"#cb4726\"\/><\/svg><span>MEET OUR LEADERSHIP<\/span><\/a><\/div>                            <\/div>\r\n                                                    <div class=\"text-wrap\">\r\n                                <div class=\"text-heading split-text\"><h3>Join Our Odyssey<\/h3>\n<\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"description split-text\"><p>We are seeking extraordinary professionals who can help us bring transformational therapies to life. Discover if you are a fit for our team.<\/p>\n<\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"button-wrap\"><a href=\"\/careers\" class=\"btn line white-stroke\"><svg class=\"button-circle\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"78\" height=\"78\" viewBox=\"0 0 78 78\"><g id=\"Ellipse_9\" data-name=\"Ellipse 9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#687477\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"1\" opacity=\"0.7\"><circle cx=\"39\" cy=\"39\" r=\"39\" stroke=\"none\"\/><circle cx=\"39\" cy=\"39\" r=\"38.75\" fill=\"none\"\/><\/g><\/svg><svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"40.814\" height=\"13.967\" viewBox=\"0 0 40.814 13.967\"><path id=\"Icon_core-arrow-bottom\" data-name=\"Icon core-arrow-bottom\" d=\"M21.328,17.9l-4.98,4.98V-14.761h-1.66V22.875L9.708,17.9,8.534,19.069l6.984,6.984L22.5,19.069Z\" transform=\"translate(14.761 22.502) rotate(-90)\" fill=\"#cb4726\"\/><\/svg><span>SEARCH CAREERS<\/span><\/a><\/div>                            <\/div>\r\n                                            <\/div>\r\n                                <div class=\"buttons inview-animate--fade\">\r\n                    <div class=\"button-wrap\"><a href=\"\/leadership\" class=\"btn bottom-button line white-stroke\"><svg class=\"button-circle\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"78\" height=\"78\" viewBox=\"0 0 78 78\"><g id=\"Ellipse_9\" data-name=\"Ellipse 9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#687477\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"1\" opacity=\"0.7\"><circle cx=\"39\" cy=\"39\" r=\"39\" stroke=\"none\"\/><circle cx=\"39\" cy=\"39\" r=\"38.75\" fill=\"none\"\/><\/g><\/svg><svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" width=\"40.814\" height=\"13.967\" viewBox=\"0 0 40.814 13.967\"><path id=\"Icon_core-arrow-bottom\" data-name=\"Icon core-arrow-bottom\" d=\"M21.328,17.9l-4.98,4.98V-14.761h-1.66V22.875L9.708,17.9,8.534,19.069l6.984,6.984L22.5,19.069Z\" transform=\"translate(14.761 22.502) rotate(-90)\" fill=\"#cb4726\"\/><\/svg><span>MEET OUR LEADERSHIP<\/span><\/a><\/div>                <\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n    <div class=\"background-image\">\r\n        <div class=\"background-image-inner\">\r\n            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"863\" height=\"325\" src=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Untitled-1.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Untitled-1.png 863w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Untitled-1-300x113.png 300w, https:\/\/odysseytx.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/Untitled-1-768x289.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 863px) 100vw, 863px\" \/>        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":true,"footnotes":""},"class_list":{"2":"type-page","4":"hentry"},"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v24.4 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>About Odyssey Therapeutics<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"We have a replicable, scalable model for drug development and are advancing a diverse programs for patients with autoimmune and inflammatory diseases.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/od